# Run a job by hand, exactly the way the Dapr sidecar does when a schedule fires (a POST to the job's route).
# Start the scheduler first (F5). The orders API should be running on http://localhost:5080.
@scheduler = http://localhost:5200

### Run the daily sales summary now
POST {{scheduler}}/jobs/daily-sales-summary

### Run the orders API health check now
POST {{scheduler}}/jobs/orders-api-health

### Send the same job twice quickly to see overlap protection: the second call answers "skipped" if the first is still running
POST {{scheduler}}/jobs/daily-sales-summary

### The OPTIONS probe the sidecar sends at startup, to confirm the route exists
OPTIONS {{scheduler}}/jobs/daily-sales-summary

### Health and metrics (jobs_runs_total, jobs_duration_seconds, dependency_checks_total)
GET {{scheduler}}/health

###
GET {{scheduler}}/metrics
